<title>POLAND: Mostostal Krakow starts trade at PLN 12.</title>
<headline>Mostostal Krakow starts trade at PLN 12.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Mostostal Krakow SA, which did not conduct an initial public offering, started trading on the main market of the Warsaw Stock Exchange at 12 zlotys.</p>
<p>In November 9.3 million of the firm's shares were approved for public trade, 2.4 million of which had already been traded on the kerb of the Warsaw bourse at between 3.9 and five zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
